    "description": "Six reported years on the exact 1.1 series. 2020 is reported in PRE-split per-share terms (2:1 split effective 2021) and reports net profit + tax rate instead of a direct pre-tax profit; the 2025 dividend is reported in EUR (flagged, passed through unconverted). Exercises normalize for real: split rebasing, the section-2 gross-up, and a normalize-side finding. Estimated high EPS is DERIVED from the judged EPS growth (no direct judgment).",
